"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds a `symbols_only` flag to `load_facts_file` and passes it from `_write_facts_symbols_for_read`, and adds `graph_parts`/`_line_part` in mcp.py, which build a `location_part(root, file_path, line, line)` for a symbol or hit only when the entry has both `file_path` and `line`, otherwise no location part is emitted. The graph tools now return `nib_answer(...)` results instead of raw dicts, and the provider gains metrics and bulk-read methods.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 334], [9, 30], [994, 1002], [340, 361], [630, 660]]}"